{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey, James! Good to hear from you. I have some awesome news - I joined a programming group online last Friday and it's been incredible! It's awesome to be part of a community of people with similar goals - coding and making a difference."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-40ecc8b1e0d119f21ee1a97c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.102112+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "40ecc8b1e0d119f21ee1a97c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "40ecc8b1e0d119f21ee1a97c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John! That's great to hear! Being part of a coding community can definitely be rewarding. Can you share more about your experiences with the online group? Have you made any interesting connections?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-af31590d8c8fe1fa165dda9a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.126905+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "af31590d8c8fe1fa165dda9a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "af31590d8c8fe1fa165dda9a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks for asking. My online programming group has been great - lots of skilled coders, all passionate about using tech for good. We've shared ideas, chatted about coding and worked on a few projects together. It's amazing to see everyone's different skills and viewpoints. I've even exchanged contacts with a few of them."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-2e19db49a48ec3ca337baadd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.146821+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2e19db49a48ec3ca337baadd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2e19db49a48ec3ca337baadd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Nice one, John! Looks like you're really getting involved in the programming world. It's great connecting with like-minded people and building up your network. Have you had the opportunity to collaborate on any projects or work with anyone yet?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-a9460ebe0acd62d2bd0ce526", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.160881+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a9460ebe0acd62d2bd0ce526", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a9460ebe0acd62d2bd0ce526", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, collaborating is great. Last week I worked with someone from the group on a project and we both had our strong points which helped out. It was cool seeing how we created something awesome together. It's great working with others."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-f5b3f6fd99f9774f9a6387f4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.182951+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f5b3f6fd99f9774f9a6387f4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f5b3f6fd99f9774f9a6387f4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Working together on a project can create amazing results, when everyone brings in their different strengths and abilities. It's cool when the final product is done and you know you were a part of making something awesome. Can we say that you are returning to working with programming again?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-7c43d5df29ef8cc710da60e8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.196724+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7c43d5df29ef8cc710da60e8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7c43d5df29ef8cc710da60e8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I think not, this is just a one-time experience to learn something new and work as a team. I'm still full of courage to start hosting eSports competitions. Do you participate in any online groups?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-c55879d90c5e2e243dc675c7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.217017+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c55879d90c5e2e243dc675c7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c55879d90c5e2e243dc675c7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Nah, not in any online groups right now, but I do have my gaming group I play with regularly. We even stream our game sessions, and recently had a get-together. Super fun!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-321f94e9c6c5bb6aa630f3f6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.232754+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "321f94e9c6c5bb6aa630f3f6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "321f94e9c6c5bb6aa630f3f6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, James! That's great that you have some friends to game with. By the way, I bought some new devices and refurbished my gaming desk."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-35ac3fb275c90248f701b558", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.246890+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "35ac3fb275c90248f701b558", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "35ac3fb275c90248f701b558", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Cool! What kind of gear do you have now for gaming? I have a setup with a gaming PC, keyboard, mouse, and a comfy chair - makes gaming for hours a lot more bearable!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-53a9f57b4bcdbc984e48a8d4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.260126+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "53a9f57b4bcdbc984e48a8d4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "53a9f57b4bcdbc984e48a8d4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Nice set-up, James! I have a similar gaming chair and keyboard. I'm currently using a gaming PC with a powerful graphics card for intense games. I also have a headset for immersive sound. Gaming has always been an awesome escape for me - it keeps me focused and motivated in other areas."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-0f1c034e78794a3192d8e87e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.280115+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0f1c034e78794a3192d8e87e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0f1c034e78794a3192d8e87e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Nice one! A strong graphics card and headset really enhance the gaming experience. Yeah, gaming is a great way to escape and stay motivated. It takes us to different places and stories. I even hosted a gaming marathon with some friends and we had a blast. We played all night and it really strengthened our bond."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-ec91fefd00f6b5da30a34d56", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.294356+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ec91fefd00f6b5da30a34d56", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ec91fefd00f6b5da30a34d56", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Sounds great! Gaming marathons are the best. When I was younger, my siblings threw me one and it was awesome! We stayed up all night playing games and it really bonded us."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-6ecfc454e4f57d6b1ac0e773", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.314308+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6ecfc454e4f57d6b1ac0e773", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6ecfc454e4f57d6b1ac0e773", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Wow, that sounds awesome! Do you still play with your siblings these days?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-e5a24d77760883d346ccbeeb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.328584+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e5a24d77760883d346ccbeeb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e5a24d77760883d346ccbeeb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Me and my siblings don't hang out much since we live far apart, but when we do we always try to plan a gaming night."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-d151159b007f9b433a2becab", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.342063+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d151159b007f9b433a2becab", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d151159b007f9b433a2becab", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Sounds great, John! Family time is the best. Are you planning any gaming nights in the near future?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-bc0461f6b961e7b53dda1ed1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.355971+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bc0461f6b961e7b53dda1ed1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bc0461f6b961e7b53dda1ed1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yep, I'm organizing one with my siblings next month. We're stoked! Can't wait!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-5005a2d79aa9f8ec3068ae0e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.371897+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5005a2d79aa9f8ec3068ae0e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5005a2d79aa9f8ec3068ae0e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Wow, John! Family game nights are so much fun. Have a great time!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-8df3b2c04c1d08e7666c3670", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.386765+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8df3b2c04c1d08e7666c3670", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8df3b2c04c1d08e7666c3670", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, James! Can't wait! It was nice catching up - talk soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-b31eac204dc0f6859be9f00d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.400706+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b31eac204dc0f6859be9f00d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b31eac204dc0f6859be9f00d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John! Good to talk to you. Have fun at family game night! Talk to you later."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-7774e83167853c627a9f7aff", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.413749+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7774e83167853c627a9f7aff", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7774e83167853c627a9f7aff", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, James! Gonna have a great time. Talk to you later."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-5e5896a0e8f9241061d9373c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.427522+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5e5896a0e8f9241061d9373c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5e5896a0e8f9241061d9373c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Take it easy. Have fun and let's chat soon. Have a good night!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_20-676a62f7dce2273a84492ab9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:51:40.440565+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "676a62f7dce2273a84492ab9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "676a62f7dce2273a84492ab9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
